# 32. Final Mandatory Rule

When requirements, mockups, architecture, current code, or user instructions are inconsistent:

* Stop.
* Identify the exact conflict.
* Cite the affected files and sections.
* Do not guess.
* Do not modify code until the conflict is resolved.
